      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oakmont%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Oakmont History Center & Museum, housed in the historic Carnegie Library, displays the borough’s rich heritage.",
